  "id": "transcultural-psychotherapy",
  "term": "transcultural psychotherapy",
  "definition": "Transcultural psychotherapy is a therapeutic approach developed to help with mental health care in migrant contexts when social, economic, or cultural barriers make care harder to access or less effective. It is used to address intercultural issues that affect engagement with treatment.",
